# One-command dev startup: `scripts/dev.py` (honcho launcher — clean child cleanup +
# per-service logs under logs/). Lower-level: `uv run honcho -f Procfile.dev start`.
# The backend restarts on a code change (backend/scripts/dev-watch.sh, under
# watchmedo), on :3601.
# scripts/dev.py runs honcho itself inside the modern-app tool container (the
# dev container has neither uv nor honcho), so this line runs there natively —
# no cexec.
# honcho runs from the root project's venv and children inherit VIRTUAL_ENV;
# `uv run` in backend/ uses backend/.venv regardless, but warns about the
# mismatch. Clear it.
backend:  cd backend && env -u VIRTUAL_ENV PORT=3601 scripts/dev-watch.sh
